'''''Rumex lunaria''''' is a [[species]] of [[flowering plant]] in the family [[Polygonaceae]], native to the [[Canary Islands]]. It has been introduced to Italy, [[Sardinia]] and [[Sicily]]. It was first described by [[Carl Linnaeus]].<ref name=POWO_697279-1/>

